# 0.3.0 shipped, so the firmware ships with it. The webflash images are what
# the /flash page installs and what the flasher checks for before it opens at
# all, so they have to reach the deploy. They are gitignored (binaries do not
# belong in history) — `railway up` uploads the working directory, so build
# them with `make -C firmware webflash BOARD=... PUBLIC_SERVER_URL=https://potatoesunite.com`
# before deploying, or the page will correctly report itself closed.
#
# The OTA .bin files (data/releases/<board>/<version>.bin, no webflash- prefix)
# are a separate matter: publish those with `npm run release` only after the
# version has been flashed and lived on a real board.

